SUMMARY:Adrian West Band Live @ The Melon Ball
DESCRIPTION:Adrian West Band returns to Davis for another night of great live music. Performing as a six-piece band with pianist (Michael Echaniz) on the Steinway grand piano they’ll play their signature mix of original acoustic rock\, a couple covers and few jazz tunes. Some describe their sound as “Paul Simon meets Talking Heads”. The band will include two vocalists\, acoustic guitar\, piano\, electric violin\, alto sax\, upright bass\, drums & live looping. More info coming soon. \nThis is a BYOB show! \n$20 General Admission\n$15 Students (w/student ID\, in-store or at the door only)\nKids under 12 FREE\nDoors open at 7:30
URL:https://visityolo.com/event/adrian-west-band-live-the-melon-ball/
LOCATION:Watermelon Music\, 1970 Lake Blvd\, DAVIS\, CA\, 95616\, United States
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://visityolo.com/wp-content/uploads/AdrianWest-2.jpg
ORGANIZER;CN="Watermelon Music":MAILTO:info@watermelonmusic.com
END:VEVENT
